					<text class="demo-hint demo-img-hint">占位底色取 default-soft；本地图几乎瞬开，淡入只有 200ms，想再看一次就点「重新加载」。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="失败态" desc="地址读不到和 src 传空串都走失败态，只回落一次，不重试。" />
					<view class="demo-img-grid">
						<view class="demo-img-grid__item">
